UID:cd880845edac4ee78bad3a383f5c7c21bfcc8c94@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260926T213057Z
DTSTART:20261111T010000Z
DTEND:20261111T030000Z
SUMMARY:SAP
LOCATION:The Drake\, 44 N Pleasant St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:with Sludge Mother & Sir Echo\nGeneral Admission (Standing) - D
 oors open at 7PM $15 Advanced\, $20 Day of Show SAP is an independent\, al
 ternative rock trio from Austin\, TX. Infusing the energetic and melodic s
 onics of 90’s grunge with emotionally driven dynamics of contemporary mu
 sic\, Sap creates a perfect soundscape for unpredictable live shows. The b
 and is composed of guitarist/vocalist Evan Fundora\, bassist Hank Barna\, 
 and drummer Jared Cox. Together they have accrued over 6 million streams w
 orldwide\, touring with longstanding bands like The Jins and most recently
  with up and coming acts such as Clarion\, Rehash and Cheerleader Roadkill
 . Sap is set to go on their own US tour in support of their new 2026 album
  ‘Erasure’.\nhttps://www.thedrakeamherst.org/events/sap-w-sludge-mothe
 r-sir-echo\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thedrakeamherst.org/events/sap-w-sludge-mother-sir-echo
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f8282d1a4780092b9b1f095523cd235c25f1f766@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260926T213057Z
DTSTART:20261112T010000Z
DTEND:20261112T030000Z
SUMMARY:POKEY LAFARGE & His Band
LOCATION:The Drake\, 44 N Pleasant St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:with Cicada Rhythm\n$30 advanced\, $35 day of show General Admi
 ssion (Standing) - Doors open at 7PM For two decades\, Pokey LaFarge has w
 alked his own effortlessly cool road as an exceptionally iconoclastic trou
 badour – forthright\, genuine\, and markedly keen to put it all out ther
 e. Rent Money now sees him pushing forward yet again in what can be safely
  declared his finest collection to date\, both as an heartfelt expression 
 of personal experience and as no-nonsense social commentary. With its twan
 ging guitars\, plucky rhythms\, and undeniably captivating melodies\, the 
 album soars and swings\, its joyous refrains belying the inescapable under
 current of constant worry and angst that permeates these troubled times. A
 s always\, the Illinois native deftly traverses the genre boundaries\, sea
 mlessly integrating the myriad strains of 20th-century American music with
  a freewheeling command of earnest songcraft\, inspired performance\, and 
 subversive creativity. Rent Money stands tall as an indisputable high-wate
 r mark for Pokey LaFarge – a defining collection from a one-of-a-kind ar
 tist of rare ingenuity and uncommon candor\, now as ever\, determinedly cr
 afting a sure-footed brand of deeply human music all his own.\nhttps://www
 .thedrakeamherst.org/events/pokey-lafarge\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: http
 s://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thedrakeamherst.org/events/pokey-lafarge
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f2e7db5ce581b140412c09c32ae9982d443dec50@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260926T213057Z
DTSTART:20261113T010000Z
DTEND:20261113T030000Z
SUMMARY:Kaleta & Super Yamba Band
LOCATION:The Drake\, 44 N Pleasant St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:$20 advanced\, $25 day of show General Admission (Standing) - D
 oors at 7PM Brooklyn’s Kaleta & Super Yamba Band are fronted by Afrobeat
  and Juju veteran Leon Ligan-Majek a.k.a. Kaleta. The singer/guitarist fro
 m the West African country of Benin Republic lived his adolescent life in 
 Lagos\, Nigeria where Afrobeat was born. Kaleta's guitar chops earned him 
 decades of touring and recording with Fela Kuti\, King Sunny Ade\, Lauryn 
 Hill and more. Kaleta got his start in the late 70s performing in church a
 nd was soon after picked up by iconic Juju master and world music pioneer 
 King Sunny Ade. A few years later Fela Kuti came calling. Kaleta would go 
 on to tour the world playing guitar for the King of Afrobeat in his storie
 d band Egypt 80 through the 1980s and into the 1990s. Now based in New Yor
 k City\, Kaleta has been leading Super Yamba Band since 2017.\nhttps://www
 .thedrakeamherst.org/events/kaleta-super-yamba-band-1\nFrom Pushpin Wester
 n Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thedrakeamherst.org/events/kaleta-super-yamba-band-1
END:VEVENT
